@startuml
title System components — draft
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "App user" as User

package "Mobile decision-support system" {
  component "Mobile application" as Mobile
  component "API boundary" as API
  component "Authentication" as Auth
  component "Consent storage" as ConsentStore
  component "Disease-class catalogue" as ClassCatalogue
  component "Diagnosis orchestration" as Diagnosis
  component "Inference interface" as Inference
  component "Mock inference / future model" as Model
  component "Account and record deletion flow" as Deletion
  component "Image file storage" as ImageStore
  database "Relational persistence\n(users, consents, classes, diagnosis records)" as Store
}

User --> Mobile : photo, login, history, profile
Mobile --> API : application requests
API --> Auth : register / authenticate
Auth --> ConsentStore : record consent metadata
ConsentStore --> Store : persist consent
API --> ClassCatalogue : GET /classes
ClassCatalogue --> Store : read class catalogue
API --> Diagnosis : analysis / history requests
Diagnosis --> Inference : preliminary classification request
Inference --> Model : model input
Model --> Inference : class probabilities
Diagnosis --> Store : diagnosis metadata / history
Diagnosis --> ImageStore : save and read image files
API --> Deletion : DELETE account / diagnosis
Deletion --> Store : delete user / diagnosis records
Deletion --> ImageStore : delete associated images
API --> Mobile : classes, profile, results, history
Mobile --> User : result, history, profile

note top of API
  Cross-cutting security controls:
  authentication and owner authorization;
  rate limiting on login and upload;
  MIME, size, and decoded-image validation.
end note

note bottom of Inference
  Inference deployment is undecided.
  The mock/future adapter is a draft boundary.
end note

note bottom of Store
  Database technology is undecided.
  Consent storage and class catalogue are logical responsibilities;
  their physical schema and implementation remain draft.
end note

note bottom of ImageStore
  Storage location, retention, and physical deletion timing are TODO.
  Store outside the web root in deployment.
end note
@enduml
